OL,3,GNEWSAReward for information about man's
OL,4,Ariver death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is offering up to #20,000 for
OL,7,Finformation about the death of a man
OL,8,Fwhose body was found in the River Leam.
OL,10,FAdam Lucas, 51, was discovered in the
OL,11,Fwater in Victoria Park, Leamington Spa,
OL,12,Fduring the morning of 15 April.
OL,14,FA post-mortem examination found he had
OL,15,Fdied following injuries that were
OL,16,Fconsistent with an assault. Three
OL,17,Fpeople have been arrested on suspicion
OL,18,Fof murder and released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
