OL,3,GNEWSAReward for information about man's
OL,4,Ariver death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reward is being offered by
OL,7,FCrimestoppers who said the death had a
OL,8,Fdevastating impact on those who knew
OL,9,Fand loved Lucas. A spokesman said any
OL,10,Fsmall detail could prove to be vital
OL,11,Fand that information could be shared
OL,12,Fanonymously.
